# .editorconfig mandates CRLF, and CI enforces it with `dotnet format --verify-no-changes` on
# Linux and macOS as well as Windows. Without this file, a contributor with core.autocrlf=true
# would commit LF and break that check on every platform. Pin the endings in the repository
# instead of relying on each clone's git configuration.

* text=auto eol=crlf

# Binary files: never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.snk binary
*.br  binary
*.gz  binary

# Generated emoji data is compressed and must stay byte-exact.
*.brotli binary
